== a week with nothing in the diary
tier: life event
aim: to live in balance
aim_role: spark
stages: young_adult adult mature elder
age: 16-92
per_year: 0 0 .3 .4 .4 .4
times: while the aim is set, a week left empty by chance comes once or twice (estimate)
tone: mixed
life: inner, nature
horizon: week
roles: friend, partner, boss
earth: a cancelled trip leaves you a whole week with nothing planned, and the phone keeps buzzing with work
tribal: the hunt is called off for a moon, and you have days with nothing asked of you
magic: the masters are away from the tower for a week, and you have days with no task set
scene: A cancelled trip leaves {N} a whole week with nothing in the diary. The phone keeps buzzing with work, the house is quiet, and the garden is full of birds.
scene W: {N} feels guilty already, and keeps reaching for the usual list.
scene U: {N} has a book on stillness that has sat on the shelf, unread, for years.
scene B: {N} could catch up on everything in a week like this, and get ahead.
scene R: {N} wants to be somewhere else, anywhere, by tonight.
scene G: {N} stands at the back door with a cup of tea and does not move for an hour.
- W | keep to the usual timetable anyway, out of habit | v: conformity, security | foot: lesson habits carry the days | chance: 85
- U | read the old book on stillness, a chapter a morning | v: self-direction | foot: place faith.seeking | chance: 72
- B | catch up on every piece of work and get ahead for once | v: achievement | foot: means money+.03 | chance: 80
- R | pack a bag and go wherever the first train goes | v: stimulation | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 70
- G | turn the phone off and spend the days in the garden and the woods | v: universalism, security | dream: test | foot: place prod.wild | chance: 66
- W>B | plan a better-balanced year and pin the plan to the wall | v: achievement, conformity | foot: door kept your word | chance: 60
- U>R | try a new practice each morning: breathing, walking, sitting still | v: stimulation, self-direction | foot: means health+.03 | chance: 68
- B>G | give the week to an old friend who has had a hard year | v: benevolence | foot: person friend | chance: 74
- R>W | spend the week helping at the shelter down the road | v: benevolence, stimulation | foot: mark helped someone in need | chance: 72
- G>U | sit at the same spot each dawn and notice what changes | v: universalism, self-direction | dream: test | foot: lesson small changes show slowly | chance: 62
works: By the end of the week {N} sleeps through the night for the first time in months, and wakes up slow and glad.
works: {N} goes back to work on Monday and finds the old rush has lost its grip, at least for now.
fails: By Wednesday {N} has answered every message and the week has gone the way of every other.
fails: The quiet is too much; {N} spends the week restless and more tired than before.
